GOLAEM FOR UNREAL 9.3.3 - CHANGELOG - November 18th 2026
---------------------------------------------

** Improvements

- Update to Golaem 9.3.3

** Bug fixes

- Fixed a crash when loading a simulation cache where the Kill behavior was run during the simulation

** Supported DCCs

- Unreal Engine 5.4, 5.6, 5.7





GOLAEM FOR UNREAL 9.3.2 - CHANGELOG - July 22nd 2026
---------------------------------------------

** Important notice

GolaemForUnreal has been open sourced and is available at https://github.com/autodesk/GolaemForUnreal in case you want to build them yourself with an unsupported version of Unreal


** Improvements

- Update to Golaem 9.3.2


** Bug fixes

- Fixed a crash when replaying a cache with a layout and emitted entities
- Fixed a crash when having instanced meshes with emitted entities in a Golaem Simulation

** Supported DCCs

- Unreal Engine 5.4, 5.6, 5.7





