** Bug fixes

- Fixed Motion Blur when using temporal AA in the Golaem For Unreal plugin
- Fixed Sequence Frame Range in the Golaem For Unreal plugin


** Refactoring

- Added support for Unreal Engine 5.4
- Removed support for Unreal Engine 5.2

** Supported DCCs

- Unreal Engine 4.27, 5.3, 5.4





